---

<Layout
  title="Wire Format Specification | OmniBuf"
  description="Complete binary wire format specification for OmniBuf: Prefix-Varints (TZCNT), 4-bit explicit wire types, single-pass overlong length backpatching, raw message concatenation, and bit/hex examples."
>
  <Navbar currentPage="spec" />

  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">
